OL,3,GNEWSAIsraeli athletes removed from race
OL,4,Aamid 'safety concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of Israeli triathletes set to
OL,7,Fcompete in Londonderry have been
OL,8,Fwithdrawn from the race after
OL,9,Forganisers raised concerns about their
OL,10,Fparticipation.
OL,12,FThe sport's governing body, World
OL,13,FTriathlon, confirmed on Thursday it had
OL,14,Fbeen asked by the Israeli National
OL,15,FFederation to "remove all the Israeli
OL,16,Fathletes entered" from Saturday's
OL,17,FEurope Triathlon Cup.
OL,19,FThe North West Triathlon Club (NWTC),
OL,20,Fwho are organising the race, earlier
OL,21,Fsaid they could not support the Israeli
OL,22,Fathletes taking part.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
