OL,3,GNEWSAIsraeli athletes removed from race
OL,4,Aamid 'safety concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club added that it had concerns
OL,7,Fabout "athlete and public safety" had
OL,8,Fthe Israeli athletes competed on
OL,9,FSaturday.
